   "issue": "`sphereWedge_homotopyGroup_hom_ext` assumes `{G : Type*} [CommGroup G]`. That is stronger than needed: two monoid homs out of a group that agree on a generating set are equal whatever the target, so the lemma does not apply to homomorphisms into non-abelian groups. The `CommGroup` assumption is there only because the proof goes through `toAdditive.toIntLinearMap` and `Basis.ext`.",
